#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:827
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{count} key"
msgid_plural "%{count} keys"
msgstr[0] "%{count} ključ"
msgstr[1] "%{count} ključa"
msgstr[2] "%{count} ključeva"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:89
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{field}, in any letter case"
msgstr "%{field}, bez obzira na veličinu slova"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1098
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "<Account>The account</Account> is the identity: an email and a password. Everything in groups is done by a <Profile>profile</Profile>. One account can have several profiles, say a business, a private and a club one. The code does not tell them apart by purpose, only unique from shared. A shared profile is used by every account that accepts a <ProfileInvitation>profile invitation</ProfileInvitation>."
msgstr "<Account>Nalog</Account> je identitet: imejl i lozinka. Sve u grupama radi <Profile>profil</Profile>. Jedan nalog može da ima više profila, recimo poslovni, privatni i klupski. Kod ih ne razlikuje po nameni, nego samo jedinstvene od deljenih. Deljeni profil koriste svi nalozi koji prihvate <ProfileInvitation>pozivnicu za profil</ProfileInvitation>."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1194
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "<Tagging>Tagging</Tagging> joins a <Tag>tag</Tag> with exactly one group, profile, event, value or file, and the database checks that. A tag without an owner is public. A tag with an owner is seen only by that profile."
msgstr "<Tagging>Tagovanje</Tagging> spaja <Tag>tag</Tag> sa tačno jednom grupom, profilom, događajem, vrednošću ili fajlom, i to proverava baza. Tag bez vlasnika je javan. Tag sa vlasnikom vidi samo taj profil."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A <Group>group</Group> opened from a <Value>value</Value> is a thread. One value has at most one thread, and a thread always inherits members. There is one root, with no parent and no creator. All other groups have both, even direct conversations, which sit right under the root."
msgstr "<Group>Grupa</Group> otvorena iz <Value>vrednosti</Value> je nit. Jedna vrednost ima najviše jednu nit, a nit uvek nasleđuje članove. Koren je jedan, bez roditelja i bez autora. Sve ostale grupe imaju oboje, pa i direktni razgovori, koji stoje odmah ispod korena."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1202
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A <GroupInvitation>group invitation</GroupInvitation> goes from profile to profile. If the invited account has no profile yet, an <GroupAccountInvitation>account invitation</GroupAccountInvitation> is kept, which becomes an ordinary invitation as soon as the account gets its first profile. A <GroupJoinRequest>join request</GroupJoinRequest> goes the other way. When accepted it is deleted, and an <GroupJoinRequestApproval>approved request</GroupJoinRequestApproval> stays with the name of whoever admitted the member."
msgstr "<GroupInvitation>Pozivnica u grupu</GroupInvitation> ide od profila do profila. Ako pozvani nalog još nema profil, čuva se <GroupAccountInvitation>pozivnica za nalog</GroupAccountInvitation>, koja postaje obična pozivnica čim nalog dobije prvi profil. <GroupJoinRequest>Zahtev za ulazak</GroupJoinRequest> ide u drugom smeru. Kad se prihvati, briše se, a ostaje <GroupJoinRequestApproval>odobren zahtev</GroupJoinRequestApproval> sa imenom onoga ko je primio člana."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:549
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A file attached to a value. The bytes are in storage, and the row keeps what the browser reported about the file."
msgstr "Fajl uz vrednost. Bajtovi su u skladištu, a red čuva ono što je pregledač prijavio o fajlu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1138
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group can inherit members: it then holds all the members of its parent and their roles. Those rows in <GroupMembership>memberships</GroupMembership> and <GroupMemberRole>member roles</GroupMemberRole> are marked as inherited and leave with the membership in the parent. Members added in the group itself stay. When a group stops inheriting, the inherited rows become its own and nobody falls out. The exception is an app withdrawing a group: the inherited members then leave and the direct ones stay."
msgstr "Grupa može da nasleđuje članove: tada drži sve članove roditelja i njihove uloge. Ti redovi u <GroupMembership>članstvu</GroupMembership> i <GroupMemberRole>ulogama člana</GroupMemberRole> označeni su kao nasleđeni i odlaze zajedno sa članstvom u roditelju. Članovi dodati u samoj grupi ostaju. Kad grupa prestane da nasleđuje, nasleđeni redovi postaju njeni i niko ne ispada. Izuzetak je aplikacija koja povuče grupu: tada nasleđeni članovi odlaze, a direktni ostaju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:840
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group contains values, and a value opens a thread, which is a group again. That is why sub-groups and threads share one model. The arrows read as sentences, from subject to object. These are the main entities, and all of them are under All tables."
msgstr "Grupa sadrži vrednosti, a vrednost otvara nit, koja je opet grupa. Zato podgrupe i niti koriste isti model. Strelice se čitaju kao rečenice, od subjekta ka objektu. Ovo su glavni entiteti, a svi su pod Sve tabele."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:687
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group public from the root must be public."
msgstr "Grupa javna iz korena mora biti javna."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1168
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group's description can be an app"
msgstr "Opis grupe može biti aplikacija"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:910
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group's description does not have to be text. The default description and every <GroupAltDescription>alternative description</GroupAltDescription> can be an app: a program written by members who may edit the group, which runs on the group's page, in a frame of its own, for everyone who opens it."
msgstr "Opis grupe ne mora da bude tekst. Podrazumevani opis i svaki <GroupAltDescription>alternativni opis</GroupAltDescription> mogu da budu aplikacija: program koji pišu članovi sa dozvolom da menjaju grupu i koji radi na stranici grupe, u svom okviru, za svakoga ko ga otvori."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:492
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A join table: which account may use which profile. A unique profile allows only one account. The code checks that, the database does not know about it."
msgstr "Spojna tabela: koji nalog sme da koristi koji profil. Jedinstveni profil dozvoljava samo jedan nalog. To proverava kod, baza to ne zna."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:898
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A key over two columns holds both rows in the same group. The schema in the code does not show that."
msgstr "Ključ preko dve kolone drži oba reda u istoj grupi. Šema u kodu to ne pokazuje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:668
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A lasting record of who admitted whom to a group and when. It is created in the same transaction that deletes the request and creates the membership."
msgstr "Trajan zapis o tome ko je koga primio u grupu i kada. Nastaje u istoj transakciji u kojoj se zahtev briše i pravi članstvo."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:591
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A member's answer for one occurrence, named by its local start date. Whoever declined gets no reminders for that occurrence."
msgstr "Odgovor člana za jedno pojavljivanje, imenovano lokalnim datumom početka. Ko je odbio ne dobija podsetnike za to pojavljivanje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:619
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A member's own reminders for every occurrence, in place of the organizer's. An empty list turns them off, and without a row the member gets the event's reminders."
msgstr "Članovi podsetnici za sva pojavljivanja, umesto organizatorovih. Prazna lista ih gasi, a bez reda član dobija podsetnike događaja."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:453
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A person's identity: the email and password they log in with. It takes no part in groups, where a profile acts. An account remembers which profile it is using now, which profile gets the invitations sent to the account, and which profile invited it."
msgstr "Identitet čoveka: imejl i lozinka kojima se prijavljuje. U grupama ne učestvuje, tamo radi profil. Nalog pamti koji profil trenutno koristi, koji profil prima pozivnice poslate nalogu i koji ga je profil pozvao."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:661
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile asks to join a group. An accepted request is deleted, and an approval stays in its place."
msgstr "Profil traži ulazak u grupu. Prihvaćen zahtev se briše, a umesto njega ostaje odobrenje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:640
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile invites another profile to a group. Accepting it creates the membership."
msgstr "Profil poziva drugi profil u grupu. Prihvatanje pravi članstvo."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:521
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile is a member of a group. An inherited membership exists only through the parent group and leaves with the membership there."
msgstr "Profil je član grupe. Nasleđeno članstvo postoji samo preko roditeljske grupe i odlazi zajedno sa članstvom u njoj."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:528
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A role given to a member in one group. In the database it points at the membership, so it cannot exist without one, although the schema in the code says it points at a profile. The role is kept as text, by its key, as it can come from an ancestor's manifest. `everyone` is never written here."
msgstr "Uloga dodeljena članu u jednoj grupi. U bazi pokazuje na članstvo, pa ne može da postoji bez njega, iako šema u kodu kaže da pokazuje na profil. Uloga je zapisana kao tekst, svojim ključem, jer može da dođe iz manifesta pretka. `everyone` se nikad ne upisuje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:513
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A role of a manifest. For each of the %{count} permissions it says allowed, denied or nothing, and a denial wins. The built-in ones are `admin`, which has everything, and `everyone`, which every member has."
msgstr "Uloga iz manifesta. Za svaku od %{count} dozvola kaže dozvoljeno, zabranjeno ili ništa, a zabrana pobeđuje. Ugrađene su `admin`, koja ima sve, i `everyone`, koju ima svaki član."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:626
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A tag without an owner is public and part of one vocabulary for the whole app. A tag with an owner is private and only that profile sees it."
msgstr "Tag bez vlasnika je javan i deo jednog rečnika za celu aplikaciju. Tag sa vlasnikom je privatan i vidi ga samo taj profil."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:474
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A technical table with no links to the rest of the domain: the `OAuth` refresh token the app uses to send email through `Gmail`."
msgstr "Tehnička tabela bez veza sa ostatkom domena: `OAuth refresh token` kojim aplikacija šalje imejl preko `Gmail`-a."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:695
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A thread always inherits members."
msgstr "Nit uvek nasleđuje članove."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1104
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A thread is an ordinary group"
msgstr "Nit je obična grupa"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:420
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Nalog"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:411
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Account and identity"
msgstr "Nalog i identitet"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:447
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Account invitation"
msgstr "Pozivnica za nalog"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:421
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Account token"
msgstr "Token naloga"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:425
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Account–profile link"
msgstr "Veza nalog–profil"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:872
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All links (%{count})"
msgstr "Sve veze (%{count})"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:866
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All tables"
msgstr "Sve tabele"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:405
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All the entities and the links between them, as they stand in the code and in the database schema."
msgstr "Svi entiteti i veze među njima, onako kako stoje u kodu i u šemi baze."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:819
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All the tables of the domain by area, with their foreign keys and soft links."
msgstr "Sve tabele domena po celinama, sa spoljnim ključevima i mekim vezama."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:431
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Alt. description"
msgstr "Alternativni opis"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1210
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An <Event>event</Event> keeps the repeat rule. A single occurrence is named by its local start date, so an <Response>event response</Response> carries that date, and cancelled occurrences are listed on the event."
msgstr "<Event>Događaj</Event> čuva pravilo ponavljanja. Pojedinačno pojavljivanje se imenuje lokalnim datumom početka, pa <Response>odgovor na događaj</Response> nosi taj datum, a otkazana pojavljivanja su zapisana na događaju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1015
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An <GroupAltDescription>alternative description</GroupAltDescription> can be limited to certain <GroupRole>roles</GroupRole>, and it can be the page a group opens on."
msgstr "<GroupAltDescription>Alternativni opis</GroupAltDescription> može da se ograniči na određene <GroupRole>uloge</GroupRole> i može da bude stranica na kojoj se grupa otvara."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:483
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An account's face in groups: username, picture and description. The code does not distinguish purposes such as business, private or club. Everything that happens in a group is signed by a profile, so %{count} of the %{total} foreign keys point at this table. A profile either belongs to one account or several accounts share it."
msgstr "Lice naloga u grupama: korisničko ime, slika i opis. Namene kao poslovni, privatni ili klupski kod ne razlikuje. Sve što se dešava u grupi potpisuje profil, pa na ovu tabelu pokazuje %{count} od %{total} spoljnih ključeva. Profil pripada jednom nalogu ili ga deli više naloga."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:535
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An additional description of a group next to the default one. Like it, it can be text or an app with its own data. It can be limited to certain roles, and without a limit everyone who sees the group's description sees it."
msgstr "Dodatni opis grupe pored podrazumevanog. Kao i on, može biti tekst ili aplikacija sa sopstvenim podacima. Može da se ograniči na određene uloge, a bez ograničenja ga vide svi koji vide opis grupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1006
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app can rewrite its own description, when the viewer may edit the group."
msgstr "Aplikacija može da prepiše sopstveni opis, ako gledalac sme da menja grupu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1042
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app in the default description decides what the card of a shared link says about the group."
msgstr "Aplikacija u podrazumevanom opisu sama piše šta kartica deljenog linka kaže o grupi."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1050
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app runs apart from Potok's page, so it gets only what Potok hands it."
msgstr "Aplikacija radi odvojeno od stranice Potoka, pa dobija samo ono što joj Potok preda."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:847
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An arrow goes from the table holding the key to the table the key points at. %{count} of the %{total} keys go to Profile and Group, so they are hidden behind the marks P and G. Select an entity to see all its links. Its neighbours then show the column that joins them."
msgstr "Strelica ide od tabele koja drži ključ ka tabeli na koju ključ pokazuje. Na Profil i Grupu ide %{count} od %{total} ključeva, pa su skriveni iza oznaka P i G. Izaberi entitet da vidiš sve njegove veze. Susedi tada pokazuju kolonu koja ih spaja."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:556
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An emoji of one profile on a value. A profile cannot use the same emoji twice on the same value."
msgstr "Reakcija jednog profila na vrednost. Isti profil ne može dvaput istim emodžijem na istu vrednost."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:584
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An event in a group's calendar, once or repeating. The start and the end are those of the first occurrence, and repeats keep the local time of the event's time zone. A value can announce an event."
msgstr "Događaj u kalendaru grupe, jednom ili sa ponavljanjem. Početak i kraj važe za prvo pojavljivanje, a ponavljanja čuvaju lokalno vreme vremenske zone događaja. Događaj može da najavi vrednost."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1208
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An event's occurrence has no row of its own"
msgstr "Pojavljivanje događaja nema svoj red"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:654
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation for one more account to connect to a shared profile. Accepting it adds a row to the account–profile link."
msgstr "Poziv da se još jedan nalog poveže sa deljenim profilom. Prihvatanje dodaje red u vezu nalog–profil."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:647
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An invitation to a group for an account that has no profile yet. When the account gets its first profile, it becomes an ordinary group invitation and this row is deleted."
msgstr "Poziv u grupu za nalog koji još nema profil. Kad nalog dobije prvi profil, poziv postaje obična pozivnica u grupu, a ovaj red se briše."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:450
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Approved request"
msgstr "Odobren zahtev"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:863
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Areas"
msgstr "Celine"

