#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:761
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "writes"
msgstr "piše"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1063
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Below its group it sees only what the viewer sees, and no further than one level under a direct sub-group."
msgstr "Ispod svoje grupe vidi samo ono što vidi i gledalac, i to najviše jedan nivo ispod direktne podgrupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:961
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It can list the <Group>groups</Group> under one of its sub-groups, all of them or those of a chosen period, show their descriptions and take the viewer to their chat or their page. A link can open it on one of those groups. That is how a group becomes a news feed, with one story in each group."
msgstr "Može da izlista <Group>grupe</Group> ispod neke svoje podgrupe, sve ili one iz izabranog perioda, prikaže njihove opise i odvede gledaoca u njihov chat ili na njihovu stranu. Link može da je otvori baš na jednoj od tih grupa. Tako grupa postaje feed vesti, a svaka vest je jedna grupa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:959
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reads the groups below it"
msgstr "Čita grupe ispod sebe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:988
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For a viewer who may edit its group, an app can make <Group>groups</Group> right under it, change them and take them back. A new one opens its chat if the app's group has. That is how one app writes what another shows, and a feed gets its editors' desk."
msgstr "Za gledaoca koji sme da menja njenu grupu, aplikacija pravi <Group>grupe</Group> odmah ispod sebe, menja ih i povlači. Nova otvara razgovor ako ga je otvorila grupa aplikacije. Tako jedna aplikacija piše ono što druga prikazuje, a feed dobija uredništvo."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1067
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It writes to groups only for a viewer who may edit its own group, only right under it, and it neither deletes a group nor makes one an app."
msgstr "U grupe piše samo za gledaoca koji sme da menja njenu grupu, samo odmah ispod sebe, i ne može da obriše grupu ni da od nje napravi aplikaciju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:986
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Keeps the groups below it"
msgstr "Vodi grupe ispod sebe"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:185
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "published at"
msgstr "vreme objave"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1071
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A reaction is the exception: an app adds it for any viewer who may react, only to a group below it, and the viewer can take it back."
msgstr "Izuzetak je reakcija: aplikacija je dodaje za svakog gledaoca koji sme da reaguje, samo na grupu ispod sebe, a gledalac može da je skloni."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:563
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An emoji of one profile on a group, as on a story in a news feed. A profile cannot use the same emoji twice on the same group."
msgstr "Reakcija jednog profila na grupu, na primer na vest u feedu. Isti profil ne može dvaput istim emodžijem na istu grupu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:970
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For each <Group>group</Group> below it, it gets the number of messages in its chat and its <GroupReaction>reactions</GroupReaction>. It can add the viewer's reaction and open the sharing of the group's link. That is how a story in a feed gets comments, reactions and a share button."
msgstr "Za svaku <Group>grupu</Group> ispod sebe dobija broj poruka u chatu i <GroupReaction>reakcije</GroupReaction>. Može da doda reakciju gledaoca i otvori deljenje linka grupe. Tako vest u feedu dobija komentare, reakcije i dugme za deljenje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:968
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Gathers reactions and comments"
msgstr "Skuplja reakcije i komentare"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:435
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Group reaction"
msgstr "Reakcija na grupu"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1186
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture a description's template takes from the device is a <Value>value</Value> in the group's chat with its <ValueAttachment>file</ValueAttachment>, so it stays among the group's files. More people see a description than a chat, so the picture's address is signed and needs no login. Deleting that value also removes the picture from the description."
msgstr "Sliku koju šablon opisa uzme sa uređaja čuva <Value>vrednost</Value> u chatu grupe, sa svojim <ValueAttachment>fajlom</ValueAttachment>, pa slika ostaje među fajlovima grupe. Opis vidi više ljudi nego chat, zato je adresa slike potpisana i ne traži prijavu. Brisanje te vrednosti uklanja sliku i iz opisa."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1184
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A picture in a description is a file in the chat"
msgstr "Slika u opisu je fajl u chatu"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1144
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A preset only fills in a new group"
msgstr "Preset samo popunjava novu grupu"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:570
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile a group has blocked. Until the block is lifted it does not write or react in the group's open chat, and cannot ask to join or be invited. Membership comes first: a member answers to their roles."
msgstr "Profil koji je grupa blokirala. Dok se blokada ne ukloni, ne piše i ne reaguje u otvorenom razgovoru grupe i ne može da traži pristup ni da bude pozvan. Članstvo ima prednost: za člana važe njegove uloge."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A public group can open its chat"
msgstr "Javna grupa može da otvori razgovor"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:436
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Block"
msgstr "Blokada"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1130
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "While a <Group>group</Group> is public, its chat can reach past the members. A signed-in profile that is not a member then reads its <Value>values</Value> and files, and writes and reacts as far as `everyone` may. It sends no files, opens no threads and has a limit on how much it writes. Its message pushes only to those it mentions or answers, and a reply reaches it the same way. A <GroupBlock>block</GroupBlock> stops one profile from writing and reacting there, asking to join or being invited. A member answers to their roles, so blocking one also removes them from the group."
msgstr "Dok je <Group>grupa</Group> javna, njen razgovor može da izađe van članova. Prijavljen profil koji nije član tada čita njene <Value>vrednosti</Value> i fajlove, a piše i reaguje koliko sme `everyone`. Ne šalje fajlove, ne otvara niti i ima ograničenje koliko piše. Njegova poruka šalje obaveštenje samo onima koje pominje ili kojima odgovara, a isto tako i odgovor stiže do njega. <GroupBlock>Blokada</GroupBlock> jednom profilu zabranjuje da tu piše, reaguje, traži pristup i bude pozvan. Za člana važe njegove uloge, pa ga blokiranje i uklanja iz grupe."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:269
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "who blocked"
msgstr "ko je blokirao"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1120
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A poll carries its own rules"
msgstr "Glasanje nosi svoja pravila"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:598
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A question put to a vote in a group, with the rules of who votes, who sees the results and who sees the details. A value can carry a poll, and the two go together. When it ends it writes down how many could vote and what was decided, so that a later change of members leaves that as it was."
msgstr "Pitanje o kom se glasa u grupi, sa pravilima ko glasa, ko vidi rezultate i ko vidi detalje. Vrednost može da nosi glasanje, i njih dvoje idu zajedno. Kad se završi, upisuje koliko je moglo da glasa i šta je odlučeno, pa kasnija promena članova to ne dira."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:726
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A quorum is between 1 and 100 percent."
msgstr "Kvorum je između 1 i 100 procenata."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:734
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A secret poll takes no change of a vote and no answers from members, and shows results only at the end."
msgstr "Tajno glasanje ne dozvoljava promenu glasa ni odgovore članova, a rezultate pokazuje tek na kraju."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:605
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An answer of a poll, with its count of votes. In a secret poll that count is the only record of the votes. It has no timestamps, as the time of the last change would show what the last voter chose."
msgstr "Odgovor na glasanju, sa brojem glasova. Kod tajnog glasanja taj broj je jedini zapis o glasovima. Nema vremenske oznake, jer bi vreme poslednje promene otkrilo šta je izabrao poslednji glasač."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:442
