msgstr "Ne glasa i ne menja glasanje: glas može da bude konačan, pa se to dešava na Potokovoj stranici."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1033
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It reads the <Poll>polls</Poll> of its group as far as their rules show them to the viewer, hears when one changes, and opens Potok's own form and voting over itself."
msgstr "Čita <Poll>glasanja</Poll> svoje grupe onoliko koliko njihova pravila pokazuju gledaocu, čuje kad se neko promeni i preko sebe otvara Potokovu formu i glasanje."

