#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:612
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "That a profile voted, and for what. In a secret poll it holds no answers, so nothing ties a voter to one. Both profile and account stay empty when their rows are deleted, so a vote that was given stays counted."
msgstr "Da je profil glasao, i za šta. Kod tajnog glasanja ne čuva odgovore, pa ništa ne vezuje glasača za odgovor. Profil i nalog ostaju prazni kad se njihovi redovi obrišu, pa dat glas ostaje izbrojan."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:730
